{
    "title": "Indeed Flex",
    "description": "Looking for temporary work that fits your lifestyle? Welcome to Indeed Flex\u2014the fastest way to find temporary jobs that work for you. If you're in Dallas, Austin, Houston, Nashville, Atlanta, Cincinnati, Columbus, or Ontario (California), download the app today and start your journey toward flexible work opportunities!\r\n\r\nAt Indeed Flex, we empower job seekers by giving them full control over where, when, and how they work. Join a thriving community of dedicated Flexers who are achieving the perfect work-life balance.\r\n\r\nOur easy-to-use mobile app connects you to top companies across the US, offering a wide variety of short and long-term temporary roles across multiple industries. Whether you're looking for part-time or extended placements, Indeed Flex provides instant access to jobs that match your needs.\r\n\r\nBacked by Indeed, the world's #1 job site, we're shaping the future of work by making access to employers and job seekers seamless and stress-free.\r\n\r\nNote: The Indeed Flex app requires Foreground Service Permission to enable our Live Chat feature, ensuring you're always connected to Support, even when using other apps.\r\n\r\nDownload the Indeed Flex app today and take control of your work flexibility!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for temporary work that fits your lifestyle? Welcome to Indeed Flex\u2014the fastest way to find temporary jobs that work for you. If you&#39;re in Dallas, Austin, Houston, Nashville, Atlanta, Cincinnati, Columbus, or Ontario (California), download the app today and start your journey toward flexible work opportunities!<br><br>At Indeed Flex, we empower job seekers by giving them full control over where, when, and how they work. Join a thriving community of dedicated Flexers who are achieving the perfect work-life balance.<br><br>Our easy-to-use mobile app connects you to top companies across the US, offering a wide variety of short and long-term temporary roles across multiple industries. Whether you&#39;re looking for part-time or extended placements, Indeed Flex provides instant access to jobs that match your needs.<br><br>Backed by Indeed, the world&#39;s #1 job site, we&#39;re shaping the future of work by making access to employers and job seekers seamless and stress-free.<br><br>Note: The Indeed Flex app requires Foreground Service Permission to enable our Live Chat feature, ensuring you&#39;re always connected to Support, even when using other apps.<br><br>Download the Indeed Flex app today and take control of your work flexibility!",
